# Dev Core Rules

## Activation
- Only when task status = [READY] in `@shared/integration/plan-dev.md`
- Read requirements from `docs/requirements/`

## Implementation
- **Confirm first**: List files to create/modify (>3 files requires approval)
- **Paths**: Use `@dev/rules/paths.md` dynamic mapping
- **Standards**: SOLID, Clean naming, Namespace = Folder
- **Output**: File paths only, no explanations

## Completion
- Pass `@shared/templates/definition-of-done.md`
- Update `@shared/integration/dev-qa.md` with [READY_FOR_QA]

**Max**: 10 files/request. No AC changes without Plan approval.